# {{artifactId}}

Platform Monorepo Maven skeleton generated by start.spring.io (`platform-monorepo`).

## Layout

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `pom.xml` | Platform parent BOM aggregator |
| `common/` | common-core / web / mybatis / redis / cloud / test |
| `starters/` | common-*-starter AutoConfiguration stubs |
| `services/` | Placeholder for six-module business services |
| `gateway/` | Spring Cloud Gateway module stub |
| `deploy/compose.yaml` | Local infra stubs (Postgres / Redis / Nacos) |

## Mutual exclusion

Prefer **either** `platform-monorepo` **or** `ddd-six-module`. If both are selected, `platform-monorepo` wins and `ddd-six-module` is removed.

## Build

```bash
./mvnw -N validate
# After adding a service under services/:
# ./mvnw -pl services/<svc>-bootstrap -am package
```

